        "description": "Task Management Module API - A comprehensive REST API for managing tasks, users, roles, and permissions with JWT authentication.\n\n## Authentication\n\nThis API uses JWT (JSON Web Token) authentication. Most endpoints require authentication.\n\n1. **Sign up** or **Login** via `/api/auth/signup` or `/api/auth/login` to get your JWT token\n2. Copy the `token` from the response\n3. Set the `token` variable in this collection (or add `Authorization: Bearer {token}` header manually)\n\n## Base URL\n\nUpdate the `baseUrl` variable to match your API server (default: `http://localhost:8000`).",
        "schema": "https:\/\/schema.getpostman.com\/json\/collection\/v2.1.0\/collection.json"
    },
    "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
